###Block: Hiveblood Creature (PDF p.1529; Dungeon 127) and Savage Creature (PDF p.1553; Dungeon 140)
Hiveblood Creature	OUTPUTNAME:Hiveblood [NAME]	TEMPLATE:CHOOSE:Hiveblood Bite (Fine)|Hiveblood Bite (Diminutive)|Hiveblood Bite (Tiny)|Hiveblood Bite (Small)|Hiveblood Bite (Medium)|Hiveblood Bite (Large)|Hiveblood Bite (Huge)|Hiveblood Bite (Gargantuan)|Hiveblood Bite (Colossal)	PRERACE:1,RACETYPE=Giant,RACETYPE=Humanoid	PREALIGN:LN	RACETYPE:Aberration	RACESUBTYPE:Augmented	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|2|TYPE=NaturalArmor.STACK	BONUS:STAT|STR|4	BONUS:STAT|DEX|2	BONUS:STAT|CON|2	BONUS:STAT|INT|-4	BONUS:STAT|CHA|-4	BONUS:VAR|ColdResistanceBonus|10	BONUS:VAR|ElectricityResistanceBonus,FireResistanceBonus,SonicResistanceBonus|5	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base	BONUS:MISC|CR|1	LEVELADJUSTMENT:2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Immunity to Poison|Hiveblood Creature ~ Limited Hive Mind	SOURCEPAGE:p.1529	DESC:Acquired template for giants and humanoids partially transformed into formians: type aberration (augmented), Hit Dice, base attack, saves and skill points unchanged; natural armor +2; a bite as a secondary attack (it keeps using weapons; one bite per round even with several heads); darkvision 60 ft., limited hive mind, immunity to poison, resistance to cold 10, electricity 5, fire 5 and sonic 5; Str +4, Dex +2, Con +2, Int -4 (minimum 3), Cha -4; CR +1; always lawful neutral; level adjustment +2. Formians accept hivebloods of their own hive; hivebloods of other hives are destroyed on sight. Restored to the original form by miracle, wish or an antidote.
Savage Creature	OUTPUTNAME:Savage [NAME]	TEMPLATE:CHOOSE:Savage Bite (Fine)|Savage Bite (Diminutive)|Savage Bite (Tiny)|Savage Bite (Small)|Savage Bite (Medium)|Savage Bite (Large)|Savage Bite (Huge)|Savage Bite (Gargantuan)|Savage Bite (Colossal)	PRERACE:1,RACETYPE=Aberration,RACETYPE=Animal,RACETYPE=Dragon,RACETYPE=Fey,RACETYPE=Giant,RACETYPE=Humanoid,RACETYPE=Magical Beast,RACETYPE=Monstrous Humanoid	PREALIGN:CE	RACESUBTYPE:Chaotic	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|2|TYPE=NaturalArmor.STACK	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE.Walk|10	BONUS:STAT|STR|4	BONUS:STAT|CON|4	BONUS:STAT|INT|-6	BONUS:SKILL|Escape Artist,Intimidate,Listen,Spot|4|TYPE=Racial	BONUS:SKILL|Disguise,Diplomacy,Gather Information|-4|TYPE=Racial	BONUS:VAR|AcidResistanceBonus|10	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base	DR:5/Magic	BONUS:MISC|CR|1	LEVELADJUSTMENT:3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Immunity to Disease|Immunity to Mind-Affecting|Immunity to Stunning|Savage Creature ~ Death Throes|Savage Creature ~ Disease|Savage Creature ~ Afflicted|Savage Creature ~ Ferocity|Savage Creature ~ Immunities	SOURCEPAGE:p.1553	DESC:Acquired template for intelligent corporeal aberrations, animals, dragons, fey, giants, humanoids, magical beasts and monstrous humanoids transformed by a savage tide: size and type unchanged, chaotic subtype; natural armor +2; speed +10 ft.; a bite (1d8 for Medium, secondary when fighting with weapons), treated as a chaotic and magic weapon for damage reduction; death throes, disease (savage fever); afflicted, ferocity, damage reduction 5/magic, darkvision 60 ft., immunity to disease, exhaustion, fatigue, mind-affecting, stunning and pain effects, resistance to acid 10; Str +4, Con +4, Int -6 (minimum 1; below Int 3 it understands no language and can't cast spells or use spell-like abilities); +4 racial bonus on Escape Artist, Intimidate, Listen and Spot, -4 on Disguise, Diplomacy and Gather Information; CR +1; always chaotic evil; level adjustment +3.

